It's in the Gemini Live app.

1369
01:43:57,120 --> 01:44:03,652
它也正在进入 Google Workspace，包括 Docs、Gmail 和 Keep，让你可以通过对话来处理自己的工作。
And it's landing inside Google Workspace, in Docs, Gmail, and Keep, so you can talk your way through your own work.

1370
01:44:04,000 --> 01:44:05,280
但这到底意味着什么呢？
Why does this matter though?

1371
01:44:05,440 --> 01:44:06,916
