Mistake three, expecting silence while it works.

1387
01:45:12,624 --> 01:45:16,516
对于思考模型，仅仅因为它完成了一个句子，并不代表它已经完成了。
With the thinking model, just because it finished a sentence doesn't mean it's done.

1388
01:45:16,784 --> 01:45:19,104
