你会惊讶于从同一个文件生成的两个版本竟然能有这么大的差异。
You'll be surprised how different two versions from the same file can be.

2215
02:50:54,464 --> 02:50:57,316
提示四，相信引用，但要点开看看。
Tip four, trust the citations but click them.

2216
02:50:57,518 --> 02:51:04,944
这里的一切都会链接回你的源文件。当看到重要的内容时，点击那个小标签，确认它是否出现在你认为该出现的地方。
Everything in here links back to your source. When something looks important, tap that little chip and check that it lands where you think it should.

2217
02:51:05,104 --> 02:51:09,504
这能增加对你创作内容的信任感，也能揪出那些偶尔漏网的错误。
It builds real trust in what you're making and it catches the odd thing that slipped through.

2218
02:51:09,664 --> 02:51:12,864
提示五，根据场景选择合适的工具。
Tip five match the tool to the moment.

2219
02:51:13,102 --> 02:51:15,024
