团队共享、幻灯片演示文稿、步行学习、音频、理解新事物、思维导图、需要记录下来、报告。
Sharing with a team, slide deck, learning on a walk, audio, getting your head around something new, mind map, need it written down, report.

2222
02:51:25,486 --> 02:51:27,920
应该是工具去适配场景，而不是反过来。
The tool should fit the moment, not the other way around.

2223
02:51:28,080 --> 02:51:31,440
好，让我把这些内容串联起来，因为接下来很有意思。
Okay, so let me pull it all together because here's where it gets fun.

2224
02:51:31,600 --> 02:51:34,240
