Start with a mind map so you can see the whole shape and understand what you're dealing with.

2229
02:51:42,126 --> 02:51:45,200
然后生成一份报告，把关键点用文字固定下来。
Then make a report to lock the key points down in writing.

2230
02:51:45,360 --> 02:51:50,960
接着制作一个音频概览或视频概览，方便你在散步时或者在屏幕前学习。
