2231
02:51:51,150 --> 02:51:54,720
最后是幻灯片演示文稿，当你需要分享给其他人时使用。
And finally a slide deck for when you need to share it with someone else.

2232
02:51:54,894 --> 02:51:57,760
这就是一个基于单次上传构建的完整学习系统。
That's a full learning system built from one single upload.

2233
02:51:58,000 --> 02:52:00,480
记住，你可以制作任意数量的版本。
And remember, you can make as many versions as you want.

2234
02:52:00,750 --> 02:52:06,640
三个不同的幻灯片演示文稿，一段短音频和一段长音频，一份英文报告和一份其他语言的报告。
Three different slide decks, a short audio and a long one, a report in English and one in another language.

2235
02:52:06,800 --> 02:52:09,200
你可以从一个文件中构建出一个完整的微型库。
You build a whole little library out of one file.

2236
02:52:09,390 --> 02:52:14,800
而且几乎任何你输入的内容都能处理。PDF、Docs、链接，甚至是 YouTube 视频。
And it works from almost anything you feed it. PDFs, docs, links, even YouTube videos.

2237
02:52:15,022 --> 02:52:22,000
无论你想学习还是解释什么内容，只要丢进去，工作室就会把它重塑为你最需要的形式。
Whatever you're trying to learn or explain, you drop it in and the studio reshapes it into whatever form helps you most.

2238
02:52:22,286 --> 02:52:23,200
