So that's the five.

2239
02:52:23,360 --> 02:52:31,360
幻灯片演示文稿用于演示和分享，音频概览用于随时随地学习，视频概览让你直观理解，思
Slide deck for presenting and sharing, audio overview for learning on the go, video overview for watching it click, mind

