维导图让你快速看到全貌，还有报告提供清晰的文字供你使用。
map for seeing the whole picture fast, and reports for clean writing you can use.

2241
02:52:36,686 --> 02:52:38,560
所有内容都基于你的源文件。
All of it grounded in your own sources.

2242
02:52:38,766 --> 02:52:39,908
这一切只需点击一下。
All of it a click away.

2243
02:52:40,078 --> 02:52:45,348
去 notebook.google，上传一个你一直想搞懂的文件，今天就试其中一项。
Go to notebook.google, load a file you've been meaning to understand, and try just one of these today.

