Google 对 Notebook LM 进行了更名和重大升级。它现在被称为 Gemini Notebook。
Google took Notebook LM and gave it a new name and a big upgrade. It's now called Gemini Notebook.

2639
03:26:54,192 --> 03:26:55,552
但这不仅仅是改个名字。
But it's not just a name change.

2640
03:26:55,712 --> 03:26:58,512
Gemini Notebook 现在拥有更强大的底层能力。
Gemini Notebook now has way more power under the hood.

2641
03:26:58,672 --> 03:27:07,472
它可以推导解决问题，拥有自己的安全云端计算机来编写和运行代码，能进行数据分析，能制作图表，还能撰写报告，
It can reason through problems, it has its own secure cloud computer that can write and run code, it can do data analysis, it can build charts, it can write reports,

2642
03:27:07,662 --> 03:27:16,932
甚至还能为你创建电子表格和幻灯片组。你可以放入 Docs、PDF、链接、YouTube 视频，甚至是音频文件，它会将所有内容整合到一起。
it can even build spreadsheets and slide decks for you. You can drop in docs, PDFs, links, YouTube videos, even audio files, and it pulls everything together into one place.

2643
03:27:17,358 --> 03:27:19,472
这里有一个看似不起眼但其实非常强大的功能。
Here's a small feature that's actually huge.

2644
03:27:19,694 --> 03:27:24,900
你现在可以复制一个 Notebook。假设你构建了一个包含大量源文件、笔记和结构的研究 Notebook。
You can now copy a notebook. So let's say you built a research notebook full of sources, notes, and structure.

2645
03:27:25,072 --> 03:27:30,272
现在你可以复制整个设置，并在新项目中使用它，而不是每次都从零开始。
Now you can copy that whole setup and reuse it for a new project instead of starting from zero every time.

2646
03:27:30,432 --> 03:27:38,192
如果你经营业务，想象一下为竞品调研建立一个研究 Notebook，然后每当你调查新的竞争对手时，就复制一份来用。
If you run a business, imagine building one research notebook for competitor research, then copying it every single time you check on a new competitor.

2647
03:27:38,352 --> 03:27:42,672
这就是一个可重复的系统。而可重复的系统才是真正能从长远角度为你节省时间的关键。
