Gemini 3.7, Flash writes better code on the first try. It builds pages and apps that work without 10 rounds of bug fixing after It reads long documents more accurately so contracts, reports,

2704
03:32:22,800 --> 03:32:25,892
以及研究论文，它们会被正确理解，而不是靠瞎猜。
and research papers get understood properly instead of half-guessed.

2705
03:32:26,080 --> 03:32:34,400
在文档方面，Google 的测试显示，在一个围绕专家级 PDF 理解能力的基准测试中，得分从大约 22% 跃升到了 34%。
On the document side, Google's own testing shows a jump from roughly 22% to 34% on a benchmark built around expert level PDF comprehension.

2706
03:32:34,510 --> 03:32:35,556
这可不是一点点的小幅提升。
That's not a small bump.

