2710
03:32:53,200 --> 03:32:58,560
长篇 PDF、庞大的代码库、大量的研究资料，都能同时处理，而不会在过程中丢失信息。
Long PDFs, big code bases, huge chunks of research all at once without losing track halfway through.

2711
03:32:58,702 --> 03:33:01,120
