2713
03:33:05,870 --> 03:33:10,948
一个模型就能搞定简单和复杂的任务，而不需要根据你的需求去切换不同的工具。
One model handling both the quick jobs and the heavy ones, instead of switching tools depending on what you're doing.

2714
