That means when it's working through something like debugging a script or pulling information from a document, it puts more thought into each step instead of rushing and guessing.

2719
03:33:34,400 --> 03:33:38,400
在实践中，这就意味着更少的重试次数，以及更少的时间花在修复它的错误上。
In practice, that translates to fewer retrees and less time spent cleaning up after it.

2720
