04:05:42,062 --> 04:05:42,976
所以，情况是这样的。
So here's what happened.

3105
04:05:43,182 --> 04:05:48,964
在 2026 年 8 月 13 日，Google 发布了 Gemini 3.7 Flash。
On August 13th, 2026, Google released Gemini 3.7 Flash.

3106
04:05:49,102 --> 04:05:50,656
而疯狂的一点在于发布时机。
And the wild part is the timing.

3107
04:05:50,926 --> 04:05:54,816
Gemini 3.6 Flash 才刚刚发布三周。
Gemini 3.6 Flash had only been out for three weeks.

3108
04:05:55,136 --> 04:05:55,776
仅仅三周。
Three weeks.

3109
04:05:55,982 --> 04:06:04,016
Google 表示，这次发布是直接源于开发者的反馈，以及他们计划引入到未来模型中的新算法工作。
Google says this release came directly from developer feedback plus new algorithmic work they plan to bring into future models.

3110
04:06:04,176 --> 04:06:05,776
这种情况几乎从来不会这么快发生。
That almost never happens this fast.

3111
04:06:06,096 --> 04:06:14,816
Google 将其称为迄今为止最智能的用于编程和智能体的核心主力模型，其提升体现在三个领域：软件工程、知识工作和 Web 开发。
Google calls it their most intelligent workhorse model yet for coding and agents, and the gains land in three areas software engineering, knowledge work, web development.

3112
04:06:15,438 --> 04:06:17,984
但我最在意的部分并不是基准测试。
But the part I care about most isn't a benchmark.

3113
04:06:18,190 --> 04:06:21,424
Google 表示，开发者的体验明显变好了。
Google says the developer experience is noticeably better.

3114
04:06:21,584 --> 04:06:23,204
当它遇到障碍时，它能够自我调整。
It adapts when it hits a roadblock.

3115
04:06:23,438 --> 04:06:28,704
当你的指令模糊不清时，它会去澄清你的意图，而不是盲目猜测并走向错误的方向。
It clarifies your intent when your instructions are vague instead of guessing and running off in the wrong direction.

3116
04:06:28,864 --> 04:06:33,744
它能更严格地遵循指令，并在多步规划和工具调用上投入更多精力。
It follows instructions more closely and it puts more effort into multi-step planning and tool calls.

3117
04:06:33,998 --> 04:06:39,344
Google 的原话是：更严谨的执行意味着更少的人工干预和更少的重试次数。
Google's own words are that more disciplined execution means less manual oversight and fewer retrees.

3118
04:06:39,534 --> 04:06:43,184
这就是那些不会出现在图表上的东西。比如你不得不说「不，不是这样」的次数。
That's the thing nobody puts on a chart. How many times you had to say no, not like that.

3119
04:06:43,374 --> 04:06:45,264
还有一个你应该知道的控制选项。
There's also a control you should know about.

3120
04:06:45,518 --> 04:06:46,224
思考层级。
Thinking levels.

3121
04:06:46,304 --> 04:06:49,732
你可以将模型设置为低、中或高。低模式是为了追求速度。
You can set the model to low, medium, or high. Low is for speed.

3122
04:06:49,984 --> 04:06:54,224
中是默认设置，也是 Google 为大多数复杂的代码和智能体工作推荐的设置。
Medium is the default, and it's what Google recommends for most complex code and agent work.

3123
04:06:54,446 --> 04:07:00,144
高模式是用于真正困难的内容，比如复杂的推理、高难度的数学、极其复杂的编程以及智能体任务。
High is for the genuinely hard stuff, tough reasoning, hard maths, the nastiest coding and agent tasks.

3124
04:07:00,366 --> 04:07:02,544
高模式会消耗更多标记并耗时更长。
High uses more tokens and takes longer.

3125
04:07:02,734 --> 04:07:04,932
所以，最高设置并不总是最佳选择。
So maximum is not always the right answer.

3126
04:07:05,262 --> 04:07:11,172
在规格方面，它支持 100 万标记的上下文窗口，以及多达 64,000 个输出 Token。
Specs-wise, it handles a 1 million token context window and up to 64,000 output tokens.

3127
04:07:11,470 --> 04:07:13,444
所以你可以一次性输入大量内容。
So you can feed it a lot in one go.

3128
04:07:13,614 --> 04:07:19,172
而且它现在是驱动反重力代理的默认模型，这是 Google 的智能体优先编程架构。
And it's now the default model powering the anti-gravity agent, which is Google's agent first coding setup.

3129
04:07:19,264 --> 04:07:21,744
还有一点值得注意的是，这并不是预览版。
And one more thing worth knowing here, this isn't a preview.

3130
04:07:21,998 --> 04:07:29,024
Gemini 3.7 Flash 已经通用可用，并可以使用模型 ID Gemini 3.7 Flash 进入生产环境。
Gemini 3.7 Flash is generally available and ready for production use with the model ID Gemini 3.7 Flash.

3131
04:07:29,184 --> 04:07:32,944
它拥有与 3.6 Flash 相同的内置工具套件。
It carries the same suite of built-in tools as 3.6 Flash.

3132
04:07:33,070 --> 04:07:37,184
所以如果你已经有在运行的东西，切换过来时不需要从头开始重构。
So if you already had something running, you're not rebuilding it all from scratch to switch over.

3133
04:07:37,422 --> 04:07:39,024
现在是大多数人卡壳的地方。
