You get the prompt library so you're not writing everything from scratch, and you get a 30-day roadmap so you know what to build in what order instead of jumping between 11

3139
04:08:15,904 --> 04:08:17,424
最后一个也没做完。
tools and finishing none of them.

3140
04:08:17,504 --> 04:08:20,420
如果你在看这个视频时心想：我想用这个，但我就是不知道从哪开始。
If you're watching this thinking I'd use this, I just don't know where to start.

3141
