在测试生产代码质量的 Frontier Code 1.1 主项中，3.7 flash 得分为 43.6%。
On Frontier Code 1.1 main, which tests production code quality 3.7 flash scored 43.6%.

3145
04:08:35,264 --> 04:08:37,984
3.6 flash 得分为 34.4%。
3.6 flash scored 34.4%.

3146
04:08:38,304 --> 04:08:46,704
在测试长周期软件工程（也就是那些复杂的、多步骤的琐碎任务）的 deep SWE version 1.1 中，3.7 flash 达到了
On deep SWE version 1.1, which tests long horizon software engineering, so the messy multi-step stuff, 3.7 flash hit

3147
04:08:46,864 --> 04:08:49,504
65.3%，而对比数据是 49%。
65.3% versus 49%.

3148
04:08:49,934 --> 04:08:50,944
接下来是知识类工作。
Then knowledge work.

3149
04:08:51,214 --> 04:08:58,384
有一个叫 GDP.pdf 的基准测试，用来测试模型阅读和理解复杂文档的能力。
There's a benchmark called GDP.pdf that tests how well a model reads and understands complex documents.

3150
04:08:58,670 --> 04:09:00,384
3.7 flash 得分为 34%。
3.7 flash got 34%.

3151
04:09:00,878 --> 04:09:02,784
3.6 Flash 得分是 22%。
3.6 flash got 22%.

3152
04:09:03,310 --> 04:09:09,824
如果你的工作涉及拖入长篇 PDF 并针对内容提问，那么这个差距比任何编程得分都重要。
If your job involves dragging in long PDFs and asking questions about them, that gap matters more than any coding score.

3153
04:09:09,984 --> 04:09:14,064
这是一个测试真实业务工作流自动化的 Automation bench。
An automation bench which tests real business workflow automation.

3154
04:09:14,254 --> 04:09:17,824
30.4% 对比 17%，几乎翻了一倍。
30.4% versus 17%, nearly double.

3155
04:09:17,998 --> 04:09:29,984
Web 开发是另一个重点。在 Web Dev Arena 这个根据模型执行 Web 开发任务来评分的排行榜上，3.7 Flash 的 Elo score 是 1588，而 3.6 Flash 是 1538。
Web development is the other big one. On Web Dev Arena, a leaderboard where models get scored on web development tasks, 3.7 Flash hit an ELO score of 1588 compared to 1538 for 3.6 Flash.

3156
04:09:30,190 --> 04:09:35,584
Google 表示它能用更少的提示词生成更多功能性的布局和功能更完整的应用。
Google says it generates more functional layouts and more feature complete apps in fewer prompts.

3157
04:09:35,822 --> 04:09:37,984
“更少的提示词”这一部分才是核心。
That fewer prompts bit is the whole story.

3158
04:09:38,222 --> 04:09:40,224
还有一点我觉得被低估了。
There's something else here I think is underrated.

3159
04:09:40,430 --> 04:09:45,344
Google 表示该模型现在具有极高的设计遵循度，并且能基于参考输入达到对等性。
Google says the model now has high design adherence and parity based on a reference input.

3160
04:09:45,550 --> 04:09:51,664
简单来说，你可以给它一张截图、一张图片或一套完整的设计系统，它就能更精准地还原。
Plain English, you can hand it a screenshot, an image, or a full design system, and it will match it more closely.

3161
04:09:51,824 --> 04:09:59,344
它甚至可以根据模型来审计现有的代码库，以检查设计是否一一对应。让我给你们看看我运行的两个提示词。
It can even audit an existing code base against a mock to check the design lines up one-to-one. So let me show you the two prompts I ran.

3162
04:09:59,534 --> 04:10:08,484
第一个是：为 SEO 结果计算器构建一个单一的 HTML 页面，包含月流量、转化率和预估 SEO 提升的输入项。
The first one, build a single HTML page for an SEO results calculator with inputs for monthly traffic, conversion rate, and an estimated SEO lift.

3163
04:10:08,704 --> 04:10:10,064
一个页面，一个提示词。
One page, one prompt.

3164
04:10:10,286 --> 04:10:18,304
第二个是：为免费 SEO 审计优惠构建一个简单的 HTML 落地页，包含标题、优势部分、表单部分，
The second one, build a simple HTML landing page for a free SEO audit offer with a headline, a benefits section, a form section,

3165
04:10:18,464 --> 04:10:21,824
客户见证、常见问题解答和行动号召按钮。
testimonials, an FAQ, and call to action buttons.

3166
04:10:22,030 --> 04:10:26,436
在日常应用方面，Gemini Spark 现在运行在 3.7 Flash 上。
On the everyday side, Gemini Spark is now running on 3.7 Flash.

3167
04:10:26,638 --> 04:10:35,824
Spark 是 Gemini 应用中的个人智能体，面向支持超过 160 个国家的 Google AI Pro 和 Ultra 订阅用户。
Spark is the personal agent inside the Gemini app for Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers in over 160 supported countries.

3168
04:10:36,174 --> 04:10:43,556
