3169
04:10:43,822 --> 04:10:54,864
Google 还随 3.7 Flash 发布了更新的前沿安全防护措施，针对化学、生物、放射性、核能滥用以及网络攻击。
Google also shipped 3.7 Flash with updated frontier safety safeguards around chemical, biological, radiological, and nuclear misuse and cyber offense.

3170
04:10:55,024 --> 04:10:57,904
现在，这些入门技巧能立即改变你的结果。
Now the beginner tips these change your results immediately.

3171
04:10:58,064 --> 04:11:00,452
提示词一：在提示词中给每个部分命名。
Tip one name every section in your prompt.

3172
04:11:00,654 --> 04:11:01,668
看看那个第二个提示词。
Look at that second prompt.

3173
04:11:01,934 --> 04:11:05,984
标题、优势、表单、见证、常见问题解答、按钮。
Headline benefits, form, testimonials, FAQ buttons.

3174
04:11:06,190 --> 04:11:07,824
我并没有说“给我做一个落地页”。
I didn't say make me a landing page.

3175
04:11:07,984 --> 04:11:09,024
我列出了各个组成部分。
I listed the parts.

3176
04:11:09,262 --> 04:11:12,704
模型会构建你命名的内容，而对于没命名的内容它会去猜测。
The model builds what you name and it guesses at what you don't.

3177
04:11:13,102 --> 04:11:14,404
提示词二：给它一个参考。
Tip two, give it a reference.

3178
04:11:14,496 --> 04:11:19,748
既然设计遵循度大幅提升，就把你想要的布局截图或图片贴进去。
Since design adherence improves so much, paste in a screenshot or an image of the layout you want.

3179
04:11:19,982 --> 04:11:23,136
用文字描述布局很难，但展示出来就很简单。
Describing a layout in words is hard, showing it is easy.

3180
04:11:23,374 --> 04:11:28,656
提示词三：将思考能力保持在 medium，人们往往会习惯性地把所有设置都直接拉到最高。
Tip three, leave thinking on medium, people find that setting and immediately crank it to high on everything.

3181
04:11:28,816 --> 04:11:31,536
那只会让你在没必要耗时间的任务上浪费时间。
That just costs you time on tasks that never needed it.

3182
04:11:31,696 --> 04:11:34,404
提示四，如果你只需要一个文件，就要求它给出一个文件。
Tip four, ask for one file when you want one file.

3183
04:11:34,542 --> 04:11:42,336
在我的两次测试中，我都要求生成单个 HTML 页面，这样我就能直接用浏览器打开，而不是得到一堆需要组装的碎片。
In both my tests, I ask for a single HTML page so I get something I can open in a browser straight away instead of a folder of pieces to assemble.

3184
04:11:42,574 --> 04:11:44,548
提示五，让它来问你问题。
Tip five, let it ask you questions.

3185
04:11:44,816 --> 04:11:47,936
当你的指令不明确时，这个版本能帮你澄清意图。
This version clarifies intent when your instructions are unclear.

3186
04:11:48,174 --> 04:11:50,016
如果它问你问题，请好好回答它。
If it asks you something, answer it properly.

3187
04:11:50,190 --> 04:11:52,484
这一轮的交流就能帮你省去五轮的反复修改。
That one exchange saves you five rounds of fixing.

3188
04:11:52,736 --> 04:11:54,736
提示六，把长篇内容喂给它。
Tip six, feed it the long stuff.

3189
04:11:54,830 --> 04:12:01,776
有了 100 万 token 的上下文窗口和更强的文档理解能力，在粘贴 PDF 之前没必要先去总结它。
With a 1 million token context window and much better document comprehension, don't summarize your PDF before you paste it.

3190
04:12:01,966 --> 04:12:04,096
把全文给它，然后提出你的问题。
Give it the whole thing and ask your question.

3191
04:12:04,366 --> 04:12:08,068
坦白说，我在这里引用的所有数据都是 Google 官方测试的结果。
And one honest note, everything I've quoted here is Google's own testing.

3192
04:12:08,334 --> 04:12:10,884
基准测试很有用，但它们不是你的工作流。
Benchmarks are useful, but they're not your workflow.

3193
